M3 parallel API (m3.parallel)
Copyright 2026 Hitesh Soliwal and Contributors to the Synexia Project

First-party Apache-2.0 module. TornadoVM (beehive-lab/TornadoVM) informed the
shape of the launch API (task graph, transfer modes, 1-D worker grid); no
TornadoVM source is copied and there is no TornadoVM dependency. See
m3/docs/m3sdk/m3-parallel-vcpu-design.md and TORNADO_API_SURFACE.tsv.
